    "id": "def:np-confidence-rule",
    "name": "Neyman--Pearson donor-switch confidence rule",
    "construction": "With \\(z_{1-\\alpha}=\\Phi^{-1}(1-\\alpha)\\), define \\(C^{\\mathrm{NP}}_{c,\\Delta,\\alpha}(Z^{\\mathrm{sw}})=\\{0:D\\ge c-\\sqrt2z_{1-\\alpha}\\}\\cup\\{\\Delta:D\\le-c+\\sqrt2z_{1-\\alpha}\\}\\).",
